sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor I as Investor
  participant W as PWA
  participant CM as CollateralManager
  participant LP as LendingPool
  participant PO as PriceOracle
  participant RE as risk-engine M6
  participant RB as ReserveBuffer
  participant L as Liquidator
  I->>W: lock vault shares, request loan
  W->>CM: Falcon-signed borrow intent via pq-verifier
  CM->>PO: last committed price p
  CM->>CM: HF = q x p x lambda / D, post-borrow HF at least 1.15
  CM->>LP: borrow, debt scaled by global index
  PO-->>RE: price tick via Redis Stream
  RE->>RE: recompute HF for every position
  alt HF between 1.00 and 1.15
    RE-->>W: alert borrower
  else HF between 0.95 and 1.00
    RE->>RB: propose buffer claim
    RB->>RB: cap 0.40 x B per epoch, one claim per position
  else HF below 0.95
    RE->>L: propose liquidation
    L->>CM: re-derive HF on-chain, revert if engine wrong
    L->>LP: repay up to 50 pct of debt, bonus decays over 20 blocks
  end
